"tut40_sn_text_text" = "Write titles and notes with the text button. While the text is selected, make its box bigger with the handles on the edge.";
"tut40_template" = "Shape template";
"tut40_template_text" = "Tap the Shape template button in the Draw row: tap a shape on the canvas or pick one From library. Copy the shape by drawing close to the template's edge. We're drawing a star.";
"tut_ai_badge" = "AI";
"tut_ai_more" = "The canvas AI";
"tut_ai_more_text" = "From the ⋮ menu you can turn AI on or off for this canvas; text, shape, and selection suggestions can be turned on separately. Suggestions run on your device and adapt to you as you accept them.";
"tut_ai_more_text_v38" = "From the ⋮ menu you turn AI on or off for this canvas; text, shape and line suggestions can be turned on separately. Suggestions run on your device and adapt to you as you accept them.";
"tut_ai_select" = "Suggestions on selection";
"tut_ai_select_text" = "In Select mode, when you select a few elements, a suggestion appears without pressing a button; if one or two elements are selected, parts that would complete the drawing are suggested. Suggest multiple corrections in the selection bar opens the same suggestion.";
"tut_ai_select_text_v38" = "In Select mode, select two or more lines and suggestions appear without pressing a button: text, shape and line suggestions in separate balloons. Suggest multi-fix on the selection bar opens the same suggestions.";
"tut_art_a1" = "Add mode";
"tut_art_a1_text" = "Shapes, text, guide and perspective lines, 3D shapes, and images are in this menu. Just pick an item and tap or drag on the canvas.";
"tut_art_a2" = "Ready-made shapes";
"tut_art_a2_text" = "Hundreds of vector shapes: landscapes, animals, buildings, arrows, charts… Resize them by dragging; they take gradient fills and border colors. We add the sun, mountains, clouds, and pine trees.";
"tut_art_a3" = "Text";
"tut_art_a3_text" = "Tap the canvas and type: 30+ fonts, bold and italic, border, shadow, text box. We add a title to the landscape.";
"tut_art_a4" = "Select";
"tut_art_a4_text" = "Tap to select one or more elements; copy, hide, delete. We select the sun.";
"tut_art_a5" = "Move";
"tut_art_a5_text" = "Drag the selection or nudge it by 1–10 pixels with the arrow buttons. We lower the sun toward the space behind the mountains.";
"tut_art_a6" = "Edit";
"tut_art_a6_text" = "Rotate, scale, crop, and edit vector points. We enlarge the setting sun a little.";
"tut_art_add" = "Shapes, text, and editing";
"tut_art_add_text" = "A vector landscape with ready-made shapes, text, Select, Move, and Edit.";
"tut_art_ai" = "AI suggestions";
"tut_art_ai2" = "Shape correction";
"tut_art_ai2_text" = "Draw a circle by hand and lift the pen: AI recognizes it and suggests the clean shape. We draw the moon.";
"tut_art_ai2_text_v38" = "Draw several lines and lift the pen: each line becomes clean and nearby ends join up. A single line gets no suggestion. We're drawing the moon with two arcs.";
"tut_art_ai2_v38" = "Line fixing";
"tut_art_ai3" = "Template recognition";
"tut_art_ai3_text" = "An object you draw with a few lines is looked up in the shape database and the mode's neural network: house, tree, face… We draw a house.";
"tut_art_ai3_text_v38" = "An object drawn with 4 or more lines close together is searched in the shape database and the mode's neural network: house, tree, face… We're drawing a house.";
"tut_art_ai4" = "Fix all";
"tut_art_ai4_text" = "When 3 or more elements are drawn together, the suggestion appears automatically; Fix all corrects them all at once. We draw pine trees.";
"tut_art_ai4_text_v38" = "All the lines drawn together are fixed with one button. We're drawing pine trees.";
"tut_art_ai_text" = "Correcting hand-drawn shapes, template recognition, fix all, and AI settings.";
"tut_art_ai_text_v38" = "Line fixing (2+ lines), template recognition (4+ elements close together) and AI settings.";
"tut_art_b1" = "Brush";
"tut_art_b1_text" = "Pencil, ink, marker, charcoal, pastel, soft brush, and textures are chosen here. First we draw the outlines of the mountains and hills with the ink pen; pressure thins the line at the ends.";
"tut_art_b2" = "Properties: brush settings";
"tut_art_b2_text" = "Thickness, opacity, flow, and stroke stabilization. We paint the mountains and hills layer by layer with a wide, semi-transparent marker.";
"tut_art_b3" = "Paint bucket";
"tut_art_b3_text" = "With nothing selected it paints the paper; with an element selected, it paints the inside of that element; solid color or gradient. We give the sky a sunset gradient.";
"tut_art_b4" = "Eraser";
"tut_art_b4_text" = "Erases only what was drawn with the brush; shapes, text, and images are kept. We carve out a stream winding between the hills.";
"tut_art_b5" = "Pen tool";
"tut_art_b5_text" = "Tap to place a corner, drag to place a curve; for clean vector paths. We add birds to the sky with smooth curves.";
"tut_art_b6" = "Undo and redo";
"tut_art_b6_text" = "Every step can be undone and redone; swiping left or right with three fingers does the same. We undo and redo the last bird.";
"tut_art_b7" = "Layers and elements";
"tut_art_b7_text" = "Keep the sky, mountains, and details on separate layers: hide, lock, reorder. You can find and select every piece from the Elements list.";
"tut_art_basics" = "Drawing tools";
"tut_art_basics_text" = "A sunset landscape with the brush, brush settings, paint bucket, eraser, pen tool, undo, and layers.";
"tut_cancel" = "Cancel tutorial";
"tut_comic_ai" = "Comics with AI";
"tut_comic_ai1" = "Balloon recognition";
"tut_comic_ai1_text" = "A neural network made for comics recognizes the balloons, bursts, and emotion marks you draw by hand. We draw a speech balloon.";
"tut_comic_ai2" = "Facial expression";
"tut_comic_ai2_text" = "Smiling, surprised, and angry faces are corrected with templates. We draw a smiling face.";
"tut_comic_ai3" = "Fix all";
"tut_comic_ai3_text" = "When 3 or more elements are drawn together, the suggestion appears automatically. We draw bubbles.";
"tut_comic_ai3_text_v38" = "We're drawing bubbles: one button turns them all into clean circles.";
"tut_comic_ai_text" = "Recognition made for comics: speech balloons, facial expressions, and fix all.";
"tut_comic_ai_text_v38" = "Comic-specific recognition (speech balloon, facial expressions) and fixing lines together.";
"tut_comic_p1" = "Add menu";
"tut_comic_p1_text" = "In Comic mode, the panel layout, speech balloon, sound-effect text, and speed lines are in this menu.";
"tut_comic_p2" = "Templates";
"tut_comic_p2_text" = "Ready-made page templates with one tap: two strips, four-panel, manga, webtoon… We pick a large top panel and two small panels.";
"tut_comic_p3" = "Ink pen";
"tut_comic_p3_text" = "Ink and fine-tip pens for comic outlines; the line thins with pressure. We draw our hero.";
"tut_comic_p4" = "Speed and focus lines";
"tut_comic_p4_text" = "Speed, focus, burst, and tremble lines for motion and emphasis; they're placed inside the selected panel. We add focus lines around the hero.";
"tut_comic_panels" = "Panels and drawing";
"tut_comic_panels_text" = "Panel layout, a hero drawn with the ink pen, and focus lines.";
"tut_comic_t1" = "Speech balloon";
"tut_comic_t1_text" = "Oval, thought, shout, whisper, and narration balloons; drag the tail to point it at the speaker. Our hero speaks.";
"tut_comic_t2" = "Sound-effect text";
"tut_comic_t2_text" = "Ready-made text like BAM!, POW!, and BOOM! with gradients and shadows. We add an effect.";
"tut_comic_t3" = "Narration box";
"tut_comic_t3_text" = "A yellow box that describes the scene; it has no tail. We open the story.";
"tut_comic_text" = "Balloons and sound-effect text";
"tut_comic_text_text" = "Speech balloon, sound-effect text, and narration box.";
"tut_done_badge" = "Done";
"tut_drawing" = "Drawing…";
"tut_finish" = "Finish tutorial";
"tut_finished" = "Tutorial complete: %@";
"tut_hint_all" = "Fix all: every drawing turns into its own clean shape (a single undo step).";
"tut_hint_lines" = "Line suggestion: tap it and every line it considered is fixed at once (a single undo step).";
"tut_hint_shape" = "Suggestion bubble: when tapped, the wobbly line turns into a perfect shape. Feel free to tap it yourself.";
"tut_hint_template" = "Template suggestion: when tapped, neat lines drawn with the same brush replace your drawing.";
"tut_hint_text" = "Text suggestion: when tapped, your handwriting becomes clean text in the same place and color.";
"tut_kids" = "Let's draw with Painty";
"tut_kids_1" = "Hello!";
"tut_kids_1_text" = "I'm Painty! I'll show you the drawing tools and we'll make a big picture together. Ready?";
"tut_kids_2" = "Brush";
"tut_kids_2_text" = "With the brush you draw anything you like. Look, I'm drawing a bright sun in the sky!";
"tut_kids_3" = "Ready pictures";
"tut_kids_3_text" = "The shape button adds ready pictures. I'm putting in a house and colorful balloons.";
"tut_kids_4" = "Paint bucket";
"tut_kids_4_text" = "Pick the bucket, pick a color and tap inside a shape: the spot you tap gets painted. A red roof and a yellow wall!";
"tut_kids_5" = "Paint it all";
"tut_kids_5_text" = "Hold your finger on a shape for 2 seconds: when the ring fills up, the whole shape is painted. All the balloons are pink!";
"tut_kids_6" = "Eraser";
"tut_kids_6_text" = "The eraser wipes away lines you don't want. I'm erasing this scribble.";
"tut_kids_7" = "Undo";
"tut_kids_7_text" = "Something went wrong? The back arrow undoes your last step, the forward arrow does it again.";
"tut_kids_8" = "Paper color";
"tut_kids_8_text" = "You can change the paper color too. I'm making it sky blue!";
"tut_kids_9" = "All done!";
"tut_kids_9_text" = "Finally, some green grass! Our picture is ready. Now it's your turn, make the most beautiful picture!";
"tut_kids_text" = "Painty shows you the tools and makes a picture with you step by step.";
"tut_lines_v38" = "Fix lines";
"tut_menu" = "Tutorial mode";
"tut_next" = "Next step";
"tut_notes_ai" = "Notes with AI";
"tut_notes_ai1" = "Convert handwriting to text";
"tut_notes_ai1_text" = "Write by hand and lift the pen: it's recognized with a Turkish dictionary and language model, and tapping turns it into text in the same place. We write \"kuvvet\" (Turkish for \"force\").";
"tut_notes_ai2" = "Shape correction";
"tut_notes_ai2_text" = "Boxes, circles, and triangles you draw by hand turn into clean shapes. We draw a box.";
"tut_notes_ai2_text_v38" = "Draw the four sides of a box as separate lines: the sides straighten and the corners join. We're drawing a box.";
"tut_notes_ai3" = "Fix all";
"tut_notes_ai3_text" = "When 3 or more elements are drawn together, the suggestion appears automatically. We draw three rings that touch each other.";
"tut_notes_ai3_text_v38" = "We're drawing three touching rings: one button turns all three into clean circles.";
"tut_notes_ai_text" = "Handwriting to text, shape correction, and fix all.";
"tut_notes_ai_text_v38" = "Turning handwriting into text (2+ elements) and fixing lines together.";
"tut_notes_f1" = "Add menu";
"tut_notes_f1_text" = "Formulas and diagrams can also be added on a note-taking canvas; select the item, then tap or drag on the canvas.";
"tut_notes_f2" = "Formula";
"tut_notes_f2_text" = "Hundreds of ready-made formulas from physics, math, and chemistry; every letter and number is editable separately. We add Newton's second law and the velocity equation.";
"tut_notes_f3" = "Diagram";
"tut_notes_f3_text" = "Flow, process, mind map, timeline, and more; steps are edited right on the canvas. We summarize the topic with an editorial flow diagram.";
"tut_notes_f4" = "Arrows and shapes";
"tut_notes_f4_text" = "Connect notes with arrows and group them with boxes and frames. We draw an arrow from the formula to the diagram.";
"tut_notes_formula" = "Formulas, diagrams, and shapes";
"tut_notes_formula_text" = "A topic summary with ready-made formulas, a flow diagram, and arrows.";
"tut_notes_w1" = "Title text";
"tut_notes_w1_text" = "Title, bullets, and paragraphs are written with Text in the Add menu; font, size, and color are in the Brush panel. We add a title to the class notes.";
"tut_notes_w2" = "Note pens";
"tut_notes_w2_text" = "Pencil, ballpoint, fountain, gel, and felt-tip pens; pressure-sensitive, recognizes a tablet stylus. We take notes with the ballpoint pen.";
"tut_notes_w3" = "Highlighter";
"tut_notes_w3_text" = "Highlight important parts: it stays transparent over the text. We mark the title.";
"tut_notes_w4" = "Pages and PDF";
"tut_notes_w4_text" = "Add, duplicate, and delete pages and switch between them with the bar at the bottom. You can save your notes as a PDF from the ⋮ menu.";
"tut_notes_write" = "Text and pens";
"tut_notes_write_text" = "A physics class note with a title, note pens, highlighter, and pages.";
"tut_offer_later" = "Not now";
"tut_offer_note" = "The tutorial runs on a blank page; when it finishes or you cancel, your canvas stays exactly as it was. You can open it again anytime with Tutorial mode in the ⋮ menu.";
